{"id":"57d3a90cf94ef42e","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-bin-encoding.md","title":"二进制编码","display":"df-bin-encoding — 二进制编码","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-bin-encoding","aliases":["29-df-bin-encoding"],"display":"df-bin-encoding — 二进制编码","depends_on":["[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]","[[29-df-ordering]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 2.1, Eq.(2.2), pp.24–25, DjVu scans 39–40","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark","revision_basis":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件","revision_verification":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-bin-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-bin-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bin-encoding — 二进制编码"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" href=\"?note=4f651c8d1bdc9a58\" title=\"29-df-ordering\">29-df-ordering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 2.1, Eq.(2.2), pp.24–25, DjVu scans 39–40"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；核对范围见 Remark"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span>；编码且仅编码该词汇的符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\">\\(n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\">\\(\\ell=\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:[n]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|A|\">\\(e:[n]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|A|\\)</span> 可以是任意枚举，不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 已含序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\">\\([n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_U\">\\(e_U\\)</span> 以下式唯一确定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(A)\\)</span> 这一单结构入口仅在指定的二元符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\">\\(&lt;\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\">\\(&lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\)</span> 时使用，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_A=e_{(A,&lt;^A)}\">\\(e_A=e_{(A,&lt;^A)}\\)</span>。有序对入口及任意枚举入口没有这一额外条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,e_A,e_U\">\\(e,e_A,e_U\\)</span> 在元组上逐分量作用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vert\">\\(\\Vert\\)</span> 为字符串连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lex}\">\\(\\operatorname{lex}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 标准序诱导的元组字典序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bits}_\\ell(q)\">\\(\\operatorname{bits}_\\ell(q)\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq q&lt;2^\\ell\">\\(0\\leq q&lt;2^\\ell\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell=0\">\\(\\ell=0\\)</span> 时仅有输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=0\">\\(q=0\\)</span>，输出空串。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_{(A,L)}\\coloneqq\\iota f:[n]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|A|\\;\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i&lt;j\\leftrightarrow(f(i),f(j))\\in L)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_{(A,L)}\\coloneqq\\iota f:[n]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|A|\\;\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i&lt;j\\leftrightarrow(f(i),f(j))\\in L)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bits}_{\\ell}(q)\\coloneqq\\left(\\left\\lfloor q/2^{\\ell-1-j}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right)_{0\\leq j&lt;\\ell},\\qquad 0\\leq q&lt;2^\\ell.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bits}_{\\ell}(q)\\coloneqq\\left(\\left\\lfloor q/2^{\\ell-1-j}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right)_{0\\leq j&lt;\\ell},\\qquad 0\\leq q&lt;2^\\ell.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat R_i^{A,e}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^{a_i}\\mid e(\\bar a)\\in R_i^A\\},\\qquad\\widehat c_j^{A,e}\\coloneqq e^{-1}(c_j^A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat R_i^{A,e}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^{a_i}\\mid e(\\bar a)\\in R_i^A\\},\\qquad\\widehat c_j^{A,e}\\coloneqq e^{-1}(c_j^A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat G_j^{A,e}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,b)\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^{r_j+1}\\mid f_j^A(e(\\bar a))=e(b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat G_j^{A,e}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,b)\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^{r_j+1}\\mid f_j^A(e(\\bar a))=e(b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_E(\\bar a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\bar a\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;\\bar a\\notin E.\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{table}_{n,d}(E)\\coloneqq(\\chi_E(\\bar a))_{\\bar a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^d}^{\\operatorname{lex}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_E(\\bar a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;\\bar a\\in E,\\\\0,&amp;\\bar a\\notin E.\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{table}_{n,d}(E)\\coloneqq(\\chi_E(\\bar a))_{\\bar a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^d}^{\\operatorname{lex}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0^n,&amp;r+t=0,\\\\\\varepsilon,&amp;r+t&gt;0.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\rho_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0^n,&amp;r+t=0,\\\\\\varepsilon,&amp;r+t&gt;0.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e}(A)\\coloneqq\\rho_{\\tau,n}\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^r\\operatorname{table}_{n,a_i}(\\widehat R_i^{A,e})\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{j=1}^s\\operatorname{bits}_{\\ell}(\\widehat c_j^{A,e})\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{j=1}^t\\operatorname{table}_{n,r_j+1}(\\widehat G_j^{A,e}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e}(A)\\coloneqq\\rho_{\\tau,n}\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^r\\operatorname{table}_{n,a_i}(\\widehat R_i^{A,e})\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{j=1}^s\\operatorname{bits}_{\\ell}(\\widehat c_j^{A,e})\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{j=1}^t\\operatorname{table}_{n,r_j+1}(\\widehat G_j^{A,e}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e}(A)|=\\mathbf1_{r+t=0}\\,n+\\sum_{i=1}^r n^{a_i}+s\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil+\\sum_{j=1}^t n^{r_j+1}\\geq n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e}(A)|=\\mathbf1_{r+t=0}\\,n+\\sum_{i=1}^r n^{a_i}+s\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil+\\sum_{j=1}^t n^{r_j+1}\\geq n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{ar}(&lt;)=2\\land&lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e_{(A,&lt;^A)}}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[&lt;\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{ar}(&lt;)=2\\land&lt;^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e_{(A,&lt;^A)}}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(U)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e_U}(A),\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(U)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e_U}(A),\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 2.1 与式 (2.2)，印刷页 24–25，扫描页 39–40。书中只编码输入关系和常量；本库保留原有函数符号兼容性，明确以函数图表编码，这是本地扩展。无输入关系时补全原书的虚设全假一元关系；否则空词汇会把所有大小编码成同一空串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span> 时常量块长度为零但整个编码仍非空。编码须有给定序，不能由无序结构凭空得到规范代表。</p>\n<p>本轮将有序对编码直接参数化为载体枚举 e_U，逐项编号原输入词汇，无需额外添加名为 &lt; 的符号。因此原词汇已经含 &lt; 时也可使用任意外部枚举序，二者不要求一致；这闭合了 PH 与标准数值输入的机器编码接口。保留单结构带给定序的旧入口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordering","status":"resolved","id":"4f651c8d1bdc9a58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordering]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau=\\langle R_1^{(a_1)},\\ldots,R_r^{(a_r)},c_1,\\ldots,c_s,f_1^{(r_1)},\\ldots,f_t^{(r_t)}\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil","display":false},{"tex":"e:[n]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|A|","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"e_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(A)","display":false},{"tex":"<\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"<^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)","display":false},{"tex":"e_A=e_{(A,<^A)}","display":false},{"tex":"e,e_A,e_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vert","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{lex}","display":false},{"tex":"[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bits}_\\ell(q)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leq q<2^\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell=0","display":false},{"tex":"q=0","display":false},{"tex":"e_{(A,L)}\\coloneqq\\iota f:[n]\\xrightarrow{\\sim}|A|\\;\\bigl(\\forall i,j\\in[n]\\;(i<j\\leftrightarrow(f(i),f(j))\\in L)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bits}_{\\ell}(q)\\coloneqq\\left(\\left\\lfloor q/2^{\\ell-1-j}\\right\\rfloor\\bmod2\\right)_{0\\leq j<\\ell},\\qquad 0\\leq q<2^\\ell.","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat R_i^{A,e}\\coloneqq\\{\\bar a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^{a_i}\\mid e(\\bar a)\\in R_i^A\\},\\qquad\\widehat c_j^{A,e}\\coloneqq e^{-1}(c_j^A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\widehat G_j^{A,e}\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,b)\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^{r_j+1}\\mid f_j^A(e(\\bar a))=e(b)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\chi_E(\\bar a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&\\bar a\\in E,\\\\0,&\\bar a\\notin E.\\end{cases}\\qquad\\operatorname{table}_{n,d}(E)\\coloneqq(\\chi_E(\\bar a))_{\\bar a\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}^d}^{\\operatorname{lex}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\rho_{\\tau,n}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0^n,&r+t=0,\\\\\\varepsilon,&r+t>0.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e}(A)\\coloneqq\\rho_{\\tau,n}\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{i=1}^r\\operatorname{table}_{n,a_i}(\\widehat R_i^{A,e})\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{j=1}^s\\operatorname{bits}_{\\ell}(\\widehat c_j^{A,e})\\Vert\\mathop{\\Vert}_{j=1}^t\\operatorname{table}_{n,r_j+1}(\\widehat G_j^{A,e}).","display":true},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e}(A)|=\\mathbf1_{r+t=0}\\,n+\\sum_{i=1}^r n^{a_i}+s\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil+\\sum_{j=1}^t n^{r_j+1}\\geq n.","display":true},{"tex":"<\\in\\operatorname{Rel}(\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{ar}(<)=2\\land<^A\\in\\mathrm{LinOrd}(|A|)\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(A)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e_{(A,<^A)}}(A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}(U)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau,e_U}(A),\\qquad U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau].","display":true},{"tex":"n=1","display":false}],"bytes":4063,"backlinks":[{"id":"8a781a879eb2b5bf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"每个有限结构按任一线性序 $<$ 的 [[29-df-bin-encoding]] 编码；$x_{A,<}=\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau((A,<))$，$n_A=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)$。$\\operatorname{LinOrd}(|A|)$ 见 [[29-df-ordering]]。"},{"id":"6b1e7a4a516bab79","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\tau$ 为有限关系输入词汇，$<\\notin\\tau$；输入是 $U=(A,L)\\in\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$。$\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]；有序同构通过该扩张比较，$\\mathsf{BQ}_\\tau^<$ 在下式定义。编码为 [[29-df-bin-encoding]] 的 $\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)$，只编码 $\\tau$ 的输入符号；$n_U=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)$，$N_\\tau(n)=|\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau(U)|$ 对同大小输入恒定。"},{"id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bd0a5970265c8091","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\cong$ 保持边和所有颜色谓词；$\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau_r}((G,<))$ 取 [[29-df-bin-encoding]] 的固定编码。$<_{n}$ 为 $[n]$ 上标准严格序；$\\operatorname{lex}$ 为等长二进制串的字典序。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]] — 有限结构的二进制编码"},{"id":"b24f25338d17d661","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{bin}_\\sigma,\\operatorname{bin}_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-bin-encoding]]；$w[i]$ 是字符串 $w$ 从零开始的第 $i$ 位。"},{"id":"d91cca50bc997dfa","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\sigma,\\tau$ 为有限关系词汇，$<\\notin\\sigma\\cup\\tau$；$I:\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\sigma]\\to\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$ 为多项式大小有界查询。$\\operatorname{bin}_{\\sigma},\\operatorname{bin}_{\\tau}$ 采用 [[29-df-bin-encoding]] 对有序输入对的接口。"},{"id":"4350a4d66b0db7a7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\geq1$，$\\tau$ 为固定有限关系词汇；$n$ 表示域大小，输入编码长度另记 $N$，编码见 [[29-df-bin-encoding]]。"},{"id":"73e3feb902982212","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n=\\operatorname{card}(|A|)=\\operatorname{card}(|E_\\tau(U)|)$，编码长度另记 $N$；$\\mathrm{DSPACE}[n\\mapsto n^k]$ 使用 [[29-df-complexity-classes]] 的 $O(n^k)$ 工作带空间约定，输入只读，见 [[29-df-bin-encoding]]。"},{"id":"e3bc57264117a705","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_\\tau\\coloneqq\\mathrm{OrdSTRUC}[\\tau]$，查询在 $\\mathcal O_\\tau$ 上取值；$U=(A,L)$ 的实际带序结构 $\\mathfrak O_\\tau(U)$ 见 [[29-df-fo-q-fo]]；有限编码见 [[29-df-bin-encoding]]。"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-bin-encoding]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-bin-encoding]]"}],"outgoing":["4de8e0c8085801f5","28e86a5f0243a0ae","4f651c8d1bdc9a58"]}